<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Hikari"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MIREI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Negai EP"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPU901701956"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1538281339"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1538283045"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation xml:lang="zh-Hans" type="subtitle"><text for="L1">在一张张滑过的相片里</text><text for="L2">又见到了你令人怀念的笑容</text><text for="L3">身旁却站着我不认识的女孩</text><text for="L4">即便如此 那些回忆依然抹不去</text><text for="L5">要是因旁人一句劝我算了吧</text><text for="L6">就能干脆利落地</text><text for="L7">彻底断了所有念想</text><text for="L8">如今的我 本该早已迈步向前</text><text for="L9">若不是你 便毫无意义</text><text for="L10">不管去往何处 不管做些什么</text><text for="L11">那些欢笑相伴的时光</text><text for="L12">早已深深烙印 挥之不去</text><text for="L13">在我昏暗无光的</text><text for="L14">世界之中 能够再次</text><text for="L15">来到我身旁 照亮一切</text><text for="L16">就这样紧握 别再放手</text><text for="L17">那双成对的球鞋</text><text for="L18">也再无法将彼此相连</text><text for="L19">舍不得删掉的聊天记录深处</text><text for="L20">分明还亲密地依偎在一起</text><text for="L21">不再相见就能渐渐淡忘</text><text for="L22">就算反复劝诫自己 也无济于事啊</text><text for="L23">如果那一天 我能更加坦率</text><text for="L24">如今悔意只在心中不断蔓延</text><text for="L25">若不是我 便毫无意义</text><text for="L26">曾深信你会对我这样说</text><text for="L27">纵使如今被你背叛</text><text for="L28">依然还是忘不掉你</text><text for="L29">在我原本一片纯白的</text><text for="L30">世界里 擅自染满了色彩</text><text for="L31">别就此消失 请再多</text><text for="L32">教会我 更多未知的事情吧</text><text for="L33">若能承认我只是在逞强</text><text for="L34">若能亲口说出我依然爱你</text><text for="L35">若你也怀有同样的心意 哪怕就再一次</text><text for="L36">若不是你 换作谁都毫无意义</text><text for="L37">无论走到哪里 无论做些什么</text><text for="L38">那些曾满是欢笑的日子</text><text for="L39">依旧清晰如昨 挥散不去</text><text for="L40">在我彻底陷入黑暗的</text><text for="L41">世界之中 再一次<span ttm:role="x-bg">(再为我点亮)</span></text><text for="L42">走到我身旁 重新照亮</text><text for="L43">就这样相拥 绝不要再放开</text><text for="L44">绝不要放开我</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Third Productions</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:29.420"><div begin="0:17.620" end="3:29.420"><p begin="0:17.620" end="0:20.520" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:17.620" end="0:18.150">流</span><span begin="0:18.150" end="0:18.320">れ</span><span begin="0:18.320" end="0:18.560">て</span><span begin="0:18.560" end="0:18.750">く</span><span begin="0:18.750" end="0:19.020">写</span><span begin="0:19.020" end="0:19.590">真</span><span begin="0:19.590" end="0:19.840">の</span><span begin="0:19.840" end="0:20.520">中</span></p><p begin="0:20.860" end="0:25.270" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:20.860" end="0:21.290">懐</span><span begin="0:21.290" end="0:21.720">か</span><span begin="0:21.720" end="0:22.323">しい</span><span begin="0:22.700" end="0:22.990">笑</span><span begin="0:22.990" end="0:23.690">顔</span><span begin="0:23.690" end="0:24.030">を見</span><span begin="0:24.030" end="0:24.510">つ</span><span begin="0:24.510" end="0:24.890">け</span><span begin="0:24.890" end="0:25.270">る</span></p><p begin="0:25.600" end="0:28.520" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:25.600" end="0:26.300">隣</span><span begin="0:26.300" end="0:26.650">に</span><span begin="0:26.650" end="0:26.800">は</span><span begin="0:26.800" end="0:27.150">知</span><span begin="0:27.150" end="0:27.590">ら</span><span begin="0:27.590" end="0:27.910">な</span><span begin="0:27.910" end="0:28.050">い</span><span begin="0:28.050" end="0:28.520">子</span></p><p begin="0:28.790" end="0:33.350" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:28.790" end="0:29.130">そ</span><span begin="0:29.130" end="0:29.290">れ</span><span begin="0:29.290" end="0:29.850">で</span><span begin="0:29.850" 