">せ</span><span begin="0:46.870" end="0:47.060">る</span><span begin="0:47.060" end="0:47.510">は</span><span begin="0:47.510" end="0:48.070">ず</span><span begin="0:48.070" end="0:48.550">な</span><span begin="0:48.550" end="0:48.890">の</span><span begin="0:48.890" end="0:49.270">に</span></p><p begin="0:49.670" end="0:53.370" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:49.670" end="0:49.890">あ</span><span begin="0:49.890" end="0:50.050">な</span><span begin="0:50.050" end="0:50.300">た</span><span begin="0:50.300" end="0:50.650">じゃ</span><span begin="0:50.650" end="0:50.810">な</span><span begin="0:50.810" end="0:51.170">きゃ</span><span begin="0:51.170" end="0:51.590">意</span><span begin="0:51.590" end="0:52.040">味</span><span begin="0:52.040" end="0:52.530">が</span><span begin="0:52.530" end="0:53.370">ない</span></p><p begin="0:53.600" end="0:57.330" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:53.600" end="0:53.780">ど</span><span begin="0:53.780" end="0:54.190">こ</span><span begin="0:54.190" end="0:54.330">行</span><span begin="0:54.330" end="0:54.670">く</span><span begin="0:54.670" end="0:54.890">の</span><span begin="0:54.890" end="0:55.070">も</span><span begin="0:55.070" end="0:55.760">何</span><span begin="0:55.760" end="0:56.130">す</span><span begin="0:56.130" end="0:56.600">る</span><span begin="0:56.600" end="0:56.770">の</span><span begin="0:56.770" end="0:57.330">も</span></p><p begin="0:57.620" end="1:00.420" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:57.620" end="0:58.060">楽</span><span begin="0:58.060" end="0:58.320">し</span><span begin="0:58.320" end="0:58.830">かっ</span><span begin="0:58.830" end="0:59.060">た</span><span begin="0:59.060" end="0:59.550">日</span><span begin="0:59.550" end="1:00.020">々</span><span begin="1:00.020" end="1:00.420">が</span></p><p begin="1:00.650" end="1:05.370" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.650" end="1:01.020">焼</span><span begin="1:01.020" end="1:01.810">き</span><span begin="1:01.810" end="1:02.230">付</span><